# Your hardware inventory (hostnames + MAC addresses) stays local.
# Template: examples/inventory.ini
/inventory.ini

# Per-host overrides stay local. The whole directory is ignored rather than a
# pattern plus a negation, so there is no way to commit a personal file by
# accident. Templates live in examples/host_vars/.
/host_vars/

# Fetched test logs are artifacts, never source. The downloaded OS image is
# cached outside the repo (~/.cache/matter-pi-images, or $MATTER_PI_IMAGE_CACHE).
/results/

# Personal AI-agent context stays local; CLAUDE.md (shared project facts) is
# tracked. Put your own preferences in CLAUDE.local.md instead of editing it.
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.local.md

# Some developers globally gitignore CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md (a common convention
# for keeping AI context out of published repos). Here they are intentionally
# shared, so override any such global rule.
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md

*.retry
.DS_Store
